                                "sense_id": "bb8d0abd-d68a-3a55-9373-9b11453131d9",
                                "text": "Less successful are the flotsam-y parts of the book — the arbitrary releases about Ebbesmeyer’s career struggles or the detailings of one too many garbage finds."
